---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Garden Fence Installation & Repairs in Wirral | FenceCraft';
const description = 'Need a fence built, replaced or repaired in Wirral? Ask FenceCraft about timber fencing, damaged panels, leaning posts and garden gates. Free quotations.';
const quoteLink = '/request-a-quote/?service=garden-fencing';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} serviceName="Garden fence installation and repairs" serviceArea="Wirral">
  <div class="wrap breadcrumbs">
    <a href="/services/">Services</a> /
    <a href="/services/garden-fencing/">Garden fencing</a> / Wirral
  </div>

  <section class="wrap page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">FENCING IN WIRRAL</p>
    <h1>Garden fence installation and repairs in Wirral</h1>
    <p class="intro">Need a new fence, a damaged panel replaced or a leaning boundary repaired? FenceCraft covers Wirral for timber garden fencing and gates. Share your postcode and a short description of the job to check availability and request a free quote.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={quoteLink}>Request a free fencing quote ↗</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="tel:+447935190681">Call 07935 190681</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sage">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">REPAIR OR REPLACE?</p>
        <h2>Start with what’s damaged</h2>
        <p>If a panel has split or blown out, check whether the surrounding posts are still upright. A small repair may be enough if the posts and rails are sound. If the whole fence leans or moves at the base, tell us where you see movement so we can check what supports it.</p>
        <p>If you want a new boundary, think about how much privacy you want and where you need a gate. Let us know if the garden slopes or the only access is through a narrow side passage. Those details can change the materials and the work involved.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="project">
        <img src="/assets/garden-1200.webp" srcset="/assets/garden-640.webp 640w, /assets/garden-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative timber garden fence with planting along the boundary" />
        <figcaption>Illustrative image</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">GETTING A QUOTE</p>
        <h2>What to send us</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Your Wirral postcode and whether you need installation, replacement or a repair.</li>
          <li>The approximate length and height, or the number of panels and posts affected.</li>
          <li>Whether there is an old fence to remove and how we can access the boundary.</li>
          <li>A photo of the whole fence and a close-up of any damage, if you can take them safely.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <h3>From a single panel to a new fence line</h3>
        <p>Photos help us understand the work. If the posts, ground or access need a closer look, we’ll explain whether a visit would be useful before quoting.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/services/garden-fencing/">Explore fencing and gate options ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sage">
    <div class="wrap faq-layout">
      <div><h2>Wirral fencing questions</h2></div>
      <div>
        <details><summary>Do you cover my part of Wirral?</summary><p>Wirral is part of our service area. Send the postcode so we can confirm availability for your location and the work you have in mind.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I replace just one fence panel?</summary><p>Possibly. The panel size, the condition of the posts and how the panels are fixed will determine whether a single replacement makes sense.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can you quote for fencing and decking together?</summary><p>Tell us about both jobs when you get in touch, especially where the fence meets the deck or a gate. We can discuss the work together. See our <a href="/services/decking/">decking installation options</a>.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">FREE, NO-OBLIGATION QUOTATIONS</p><h2>Tell us about your fence</h2></div>
      <a class="btn gold" href={quoteLink}>Request a free quote ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
